fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#gst_debug_log_id_with_context_valist","fragment":"\n\tgst_debug_log_id_with_context_valist\n\nLogs a message with the specified context and ID. If the context has already\nseen this message based on its flags configuration, the message will not be\nlogged.\nlevel >= GST_LEVEL_MEMDUMP is not supported.\nParameters:\na GstLogContext\nlevel of the message\nthe file that emitted the message, usually the FILE identifier\nthe function that emitted the message\nthe line that emitted the message, usually the LINE identifier\nthe contextual ID of the message\na printf style format string\noptional arguments for the format string\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});